This repository contains example smart contracts and developer tooling for the
Thebes Layer 1. The examples are written in Motoko and Rust and build on the
Internet Computer Canister Development Kit (IC CDK):

  • ic-cdk (Rust)        — © DFINITY Foundation, Apache-2.0
                            https://github.com/dfinity/cdk-rs
  • Motoko base/runtime  — © DFINITY Foundation, Apache-2.0
                            https://github.com/dfinity/motoko

The IC CDK is the work of the DFINITY Foundation and the Internet Computer
community. Thebes smart contracts are source-compatible with the IC CDK
programming model; we gratefully acknowledge that foundation. Thebes itself is a
distinct, post-quantum, Byzantine-fault-tolerant Layer 1 — see the README.

Nothing in this repository contains Thebes chain data, validator binaries, or
node keys; it is examples, tooling, and documentation only.
